OL,3,GNEWSADesign unveiled for new
OL,4,Acrematorium
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed design for a new
OL,7,Fcrematorium in Derby has been
OL,8,Fpublished.
OL,10,FDerby City Council has detailed its
OL,11,Fplans to rebuild the Markeaton
OL,12,FCrematorium on land next to its current
OL,13,Fsite, before demolishing the existing
OL,14,Fbuilding.
OL,16,FThe current building dates back to
OL,17,F1956, but the council said the building
OL,18,Flayout and facilities are "becoming
OL,19,Fdated following decades of use".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
